    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d41-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d41-f1-content">
                <p>Source: National Security Council, National Security Council Institutional Files,
                    Box SR–104, NSC 00118. Secret. Copies were sent to Bush and Regan. Prepared by
                    Wright and Kraemer. A stamped notation in the top right-hand corner of the
                    memorandum indicates Reagan saw it. Reagan wrote his initials in the top
                    right-hand corner of the memorandum. The meeting was scheduled to take place on
                    June 3 from 11:00 a.m. until noon in the Cabinet Room.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d41-f2" n="2" xml:id="d41-f2-content">
                <p>Attached but not printed is the agenda.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d41-f3" n="3" xml:id="d41-f3-content">
